    "project_purpose": "Scrub Money is a decentralized commerce and services ecosystem spanning DeFi vaults and strategies, NFT marketplace and staking through Scrubplace, peer-to-peer sports markets through Kava Football Club, crypto commerce and gift cards through Lion Commerce, and on-chain games through Scrub Games. Its ecosystem also references LION as a future-backed stablecoin and TIGER as a related token, but the brief should not characterize LION as an algorithmic stablecoin or claim broad basis-trading functionality without independent support.",
